{"availability":"available","full":"a2aproject/a2a-cli","name":"a2a-cli","description":"The official command-line interface for interacting with A2A (Agent2Agent) compatible agents.","category":"Other","language":"Go","stars":144,"forks":13,"created":"2026-07-28T15:03:13Z","updated":"2026-10-01T16:16:01Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","stars":144,"forks":13}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Discover, message, and manage A2A agents from your terminal.","The A2A CLI (a2a) is the official command-line client for A2A (Agent2Agent) agents, maintained by the A2A Project Team.","A2A is a bidirectional protocol: any A2A agent can act as a client to another and hand off a task. But an agent without an A2A layer can't easily send messages or receive updates. The A2A CLI fills that gap."],"features":["Empower AI coding assistants — give your coding agent the a2a tool to offload work to remote A2A agents.","Interact instantly — fetch agent cards, send messages, and stream real-time updates from the terminal.","Automate workflows — seamlessly integrate A2A agents with non A2A Agents and build pipelines by taking advanteage of cli's protocol-native JSON outputs and predictable exit codes."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-cli/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"567517842251aa3f1829614356e7498d1442b431edb32341db49183571a7f3f1","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:48.764Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Discover, message, and manage A2A agents from your terminal.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-cli/blob/main/README.md"},"audien